{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>HOY人氣處境劇《你的保安李寶安》最新一集，上集有前女優濱崎真緒加盟，大獲好評！來到今晚第11集，前TVB小花江嘉敏加盟相當有驚喜！</p>\n<h2>羅宋湯慘戴綠帽揭開驚天身世之謎</h2>\n<p>第11集劇情講述，神秘高層秘書Creamy小忌廉強勢突襲保安部，期間與羅宋湯舉止極度親密。深愛男方阿彩因吃醋而展開瘋狂追查，意外揭發二人不僅曾經同居，目前更處於商議離婚及分配家產階段，甚至已經育有1名小孩。正當阿彩深明大義甘願承擔共同撫養孩子責任時，Creamy小忌廉竟當眾爆出「孩子不是羅宋湯的」震撼宣言，令劇情瞬間推向高潮。</p>\n<h2>江嘉敏社交平台分享爆笑幕後花絮</h2>\n<p>飾演Creamy小忌廉女星江嘉敏隨即在社交平台大爆拍攝感受，並上載多張充滿歡樂氣氛幕後合照。她對於劇中角色遭遇幽默留言「難得～Creamy姐被仔飛，Sad緊，平時係我飛人㗎嘛」。她特別提到同劇演員為了完成合照，二話不說換回整套保安制服，當有網民好奇追問邱副隊長下半身衣著時，她亦搞笑親自證實「有著👖」。她更展示1張與導演精心修圖2小時合照，力證整個劇組合作充滿火花。</p>\n<h2>秘書小忌廉強勢介入觸發三角戀危機</h2>\n<p>劇中錯綜複雜三角關係成為整集最大亮點，江嘉敏同妹頭（阿彩）為爭奪男主角各出奇謀。阿彩一直誤會男方與秘書小忌廉之間只屬普通同事關係，直到殘酷真相浮出水面才驚覺自己一直處於劣勢。江嘉敏那種帶點挑剔又高傲姿態，與阿彩那份單純可愛形成極強烈對比。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚：江嘉敏做得自然又搞笑</h2>\n<p>大批觀眾看畢此集後紛紛湧入討論區踴躍留言，一致認為今集劇情緊湊程度已經超越早前好彩食麻糬一幕。不少網民高度評價兩位女角表現，特別指出「妹姐好生鬼好可愛，meaning夠養眼」，同時亦有大批留言讚賞「江嘉敏做得自然又搞笑」。觀眾普遍認為江嘉敏將角色那種高傲氣質拿捏得恰到好處，即使展現挑剔一面依然充滿喜感，紛紛留言表達會繼續期待這條感情線發展。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730314040814_6572828066af47b87bdcc8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730314040814_6572828066af47b87bdcc8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>來到今晚第11集，前TVB小花江嘉敏加盟相當有驚喜！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730825880848_5754567316af47b8c9975f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-9\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440730825880848_5754567316af47b8c9975f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>喜感十足！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731174063155_18549002886af47b90213de.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"media-10\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731174063155_18549002886af47b90213de.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>妹頭演出都有進步！（圖片來源：HOY）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731680150951_5915351626af47b954e8a0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731680150951_5915351626af47b954e8a0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>神秘高層秘書Creamy小忌廉強勢突襲保安部，期間與羅宋湯舉止極度親密。（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731925253463_17765642916af47b97b542c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440731925253463_17765642916af47b97b542c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>她更展示1張與導演精心修圖2小時合照，力證整個劇組合作充滿火花。（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440732356338144_2185498026af47b9c0b41f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440732356338144_2185498026af47b9c0b41f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944073257332429_3111672236af47b9e1067a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17944073257332429_3111672236af47b9e1067a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794407328255592_2407050636af47ba0ae08c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794407328255592_2407050636af47ba0ae08c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440733027369346_6410716836af47ba2c6627.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179440733027369346_6410716836af47ba2c6627.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：江嘉敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:39:37.959316+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1205,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:28:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:14:42.297625+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:33:07.691834+00:00","content_hash":"4523a3f9130f43db7784fdaf4d6eac95139cfe0a76e359edd2e893f5284a0bad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}